        "2 cups cherry tomatoes, halved",
        "2 medium zucchini, diced",
        "1 tbsp olive oil (total for entire recipe)",
        "3 cloves garlic, minced",
        "1/2 tsp salt",
        "1/4 tsp garlic powder",
        "1/4 cup reserved pasta water",
        "Fresh basil leaves for garnish (optional)"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "Cook pasta per package instructions to al dente. Reserve 1/4 cup pasta water before draining.",
        "Pat shrimp dry with paper towels. Season lightly with salt and garlic powder.",
        "Heat 1/2 tbsp olive oil in a large non-stick skillet over medium heat.",
        "Add zucchini and cook 3-4 minutes until just tender. Remove and set aside.",
        "Add remaining 1/2 tbsp olive oil to pan. Add minced garlic and cook 30 seconds.",
        "Add cherry tomatoes and cook 3 minutes until they start to soften and burst slightly.",
        "Add shrimp to pan and cook 2-3 minutes per side until pink and cooked through.",
        "Return zucchini to pan, add drained pasta and splash of pasta water. Toss gently.",
        "Divide evenly among 4 plates. Garnish with fresh basil if desired.",
        "For toddlers cut shrimp into small pieces before serving."
