        "Roast zucchini boats 10 minutes while preparing filling.",
        "Heat remaining olive oil in skillet over medium heat. Add ground turkey and break apart.",
        "Cook turkey 6-7 minutes until no longer pink. Season with garlic powder, onion powder, salt.",
