        "Add diced cherry tomatoes and chicken broth. Stir and cook 2 minutes.",
        "Spoon turkey mixture generously into roasted zucchini boats. Top with light sprinkle of cheddar.",
        "Return to oven 5-7 minutes until cheese melts and zucchini is tender.",
        "Serve each adult 2 zucchini boat halves alongside 1.5 cups rice. For toddlers scoop filling out and serve over rice with soft zucchini pieces."
